%% (b) What-if scenario — natural language or drag-and-drop → Monte Carlo → ranked plans (NFR: 200 reps × 30 d < 20 s)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Planner
  participant UI as Web app (Scenario Lab)
  participant C as Copilot (Claude tools)
  participant A as API
  participant R as Redis (cache + queue)
  participant S as Sim orchestrator (MC pool, 8 workers)
  participant TW as Twin state
  participant O as Optimizer

  alt Copilot
    P->>C: "What if a cyclone closes Chennai port for 5 days?"
    C->>A: create_scenario(spec JSON — strict schema)
  else Drag and drop
    P->>UI: drop "Cyclone" card on PORT_CHENNAI
    UI->>A: POST /scenarios {type, target, start, duration_h, severity}
  end
  A->>A: validate spec · RBAC(planner) · spec_hash = sha256(canonical JSON)
  A->>R: GET scenario:{spec_hash}
  alt cache hit
    R-->>A: cached results
  else cache miss
    A->>R: enqueue job {scenario_id, n_reps: 500}
    A-->>UI: 202 {scenario_id}
    UI->>A: WS /ws/scenarios/{id}
    S->>R: pop job
    S->>TW: snapshot() — current network, stock, in-flight shipments
    loop 500 replications (seeds 1000–1499, common random numbers)
      S->>S: SimPy run 30 sim-days with disruption injector
      S-->>A: progress (n / 500)
      A-->>UI: progress ring
    end
    S->>S: aggregate P10/P50/P90, TTS/TTR, stock-out probability
    S->>O: at-risk nodes + surplus nodes
    O->>O: k-shortest multimodal reroutes · min-cost-flow reallocation · expedite · buffer
    O->>S: evaluate each candidate (MC, N = 200, same seeds)
    O-->>A: candidates with KPIs → Pareto front → weighted score
    A->>R: SET scenario:{spec_hash} (results)
  end
  A-->>UI: results: fan chart bands, Pareto, top-3 plans + explanations
  UI-->>P: Baseline vs Mitigated split maps
